<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Galat Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">GALAT YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galat Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALAT YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Mwen, Paul, yon apot <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:11">Gal 1:11</ref></char></note>ki pa t voye pa lèzòm, ni pa okenn ajans lòm, men pa Jésus Kri, ak Bondye Papa a, ki te fè L leve soti nan lanmò— <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />ak tout frè ki avèk mwen yo; a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:6">Trav 16:6</ref></char></note>legliz nan Galatie yo: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Gras pou nou menm ak lapè ki sòti nan Bondye, Papa nou an, ak Senyè a, Jésus Kri, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref></char></note>te bay tèt li pou peche nou yo, pou Li ta kapab delivre nou de tan mechan sila a, selon volonte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:20">Fil 4:20</ref></char></note>Bondye ak Papa nou an. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />A li menm laglwa pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Mwen sezi ke nou ase vit ap abandone Sila ki te rele nou pa lagras a Kris la, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:4">II Kwo 11:4</ref></char></note>yon lòt levanjil; <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />ki pa vrèman yon lòt, men sèlman gen kèk moun k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:24">Trav 15:24</ref></char></note>twouble nou e ki vle defòme levanjil a Kris la. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Men menmsi nou menm, oubyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:14">II Kor 11:14</ref></char></note>yon zanj ki soti nan syèl la, ta preche a nou yon levanjil ki apa de sila nou te preche a nou menm nan, li ta dwe madichonnen. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Jan nou te di nou avan an, donk mwen di nou koulye a ankò, si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:17">Wo 16:17</ref></char></note>yon moun ap preche nou yon levanjil ki kontrè de sila nou te resevwa a, li dwe madichonnen.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Alò, èske koulye a mwen ap chache favè lòm, oubyen Bondye? Oubyen èske m ap fòse fè lòm plezi? Si mwen t ap toujou eseye fè lòm plezi, mwen pa t ap yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:1">Wo 1:1</ref></char></note>sèvitè a Kris la.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:16">Wo 2:16</ref></char></note>mwen ta fè nou konnen, frè m yo, ke levanjil ki te preche pa mwen menm nan se pa selon lòm. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Paske mwen pa t ni resevwa l soti nan lòm, ni mwen pa t enstwi pou li, men mwen te resevwa l atravè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:10">I Kor 2:10</ref></char></note>revelasyon a Jésus Kri. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Paske, nou konn tande listwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:4">Trav 26:4</ref></char></note>fason lavi mwen nan lafwa Jwif la; jan mwen te konn pèsekite legliz a Bondye a depase limit, e te eseye detwi li. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Konsa, mwen t ap avanse nan relijyon Jwif la depase anpil nan moun Jwif parèy mwen yo akoz ke mwen te ekstrèmman zele pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:2">Mat 15:2</ref></char></note>tradisyon zansèt mwen yo. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Men lè Bondye, ki te mete m apa depi nan vant manman m nan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:1">És 49:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 49:5">5</ref></char></note>te rele mwen selon gras Li a, te kontan <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />pou revele Fis Li a nan mwen menm, pou mwen ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>preche li pami pèp etranje yo, mwen pa t nan moman sa a konsilte avèk chè ak san. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:19-22">Trav 9:19-22</ref></char></note>Ni mwen pa t monte Jérusalem pou jwenn sila ki te apot avan mwen yo, men mwen te ale an Arabie, e mwen te retounen yon fwa ankò vè Damas.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Answit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:22">Trav 9:22</ref></char></note>twaz an pita, mwen te monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26">Trav 9:26</ref></char></note>Jérusalem pou fè konesans ak Céphas, e te rete avèk li pandan kenz jou. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Men mwen pa t wè okenn nan lòt apot yo eksepte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref></char></note>Jacques, frè a Senyè a. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />(Alò, nan sa ke m ap ekri nou an, mwen bannou asirans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:1">Wo 9:1</ref></char></note>devan Bondye ke mwen p ap bay manti.) <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:30">Trav 9:30</ref></char></note>mwen te ale nan rejyon Syrie ak Cilicie. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Mwen te toujou enkoni devan zye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:14">I Tes 2:14</ref></char></note>legliz Judée ki te an Kris yo, <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />men sèlman, yo te kontinye tande: “Sila ki te konn pèsekite nou an koulye a ap preche lafwa ke avan li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:21">Trav 9:21</ref></char></note>eseye detwi a.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Konsa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:8">Mat 9:8</ref></char></note>t ap bay Bondye glwa akoz de mwen menm.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Answit, apre yon espas katòz ane mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:2">Trav 15:2</ref></char></note>te monte ankò Jérusalem avèk Barnabas, e mwen te pran Tite osi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Se te akoz yon revelasyon ke mwen te monte a. Epi konsa, mwen te soumèt devan yo menm levanjil ke mwen preche pami pèp etranje yo. Men mwen te fè sa an prive a sila ki te gen repitasyon yo, pou lakrent ke mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">I Kor 9:24</ref></char></note>ta ka petèt kouri, oubyen te kouri anven. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Men pa menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:13">II Kor 2:13</ref></char></note>Tite ki te avèk mwen an, malgre li te yon Grèk, pa t oblije sikonsi. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Men se te akoz de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">Trav 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:24">24</ref></char></note>fo frè yo ki te antre an kachèt pou espyone libète ke nou gen nan Kris Jésus a, pou yo ta ka mennen nou nan esklavaj. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Men nou pa t soumèt a yo menm pandan menm yon moman, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:6">Gal 1:6</ref></char></note>verite levanjil la ta kapab rete avèk nou tout. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Men de sila ki te gen gwo repitasyon yo—sa yo te ye pa gen enpòtans pou mwen; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:34">Trav 10:34</ref></char></note>Bondye pa nan patipri—byen, sila ki te gen repitasyon yo pa t ogmante anyen anplis pou mwen. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Men okontrè, yo te wè ke levanjil la te konfye a mwen menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>pou ensikonsi yo, menm jan ke li te konfye a Pierre pou sikonsi yo. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Paske Sila ki te an reyalite travay atravè Pierre kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:25">Trav 1:25</ref></char></note>apot pou sikonsi yo, te an reyalite travay atravè mwen menm tou anvè pèp etranje yo. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Konsa, ak rekonesans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>gras ke m te resevwa, Jacques, Céphas, ak Jean, ki te gen repitasyon kòm pilye lafwa yo, te ban mwen ak Barnabas lamen dwat dasosiyasyon, pou nou te kapab ale kote pèp etranje yo e yo menm kote sikonsi yo. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Yo te sèlman mande nou pou nou sonje pòv yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:17">Trav 24:17</ref></char></note>bagay ke mwen te vrèman vle fè.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:18">Gal 1:18</ref></char></note>Céphas te vini Antioche, mwen te opoze a li menm nan toudwat devan l, paske li te rete kondane. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Paske avan moun a Jacques yo te vini, li te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:3">Trav 11:3</ref></char></note>manje avèk pèp etranje yo. Men lè yo te vini, li te kòmanse fè bak pou rete a leka, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:2">Trav 11:2</ref></char></note>lakrent pati sikonsizyon an. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Rès Jwif yo te vin jwenn avè l nan ipokrizi a, avèk rezilta ke menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Barnabas te pote ale pa ipokrizi yo a. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Men lè mwen te wè ke yo pa t mache dwat selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:5">Gal 2:5</ref></char></note>verite levanjil la, mwen te di a Céphas nan prezans a tout moun: “Si ou menm, kòm yon Jwif, viv kon pèp etranje yo e pa tankou Jwif, kòman ou ka fòse pèp etranje yo viv tankou Jwif?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Nou menm ki se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:4">Fil 3:4</ref></char></note>Jwif pa lanati e pa pechè ki sòti pami pèp etranje yo, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />sepandan, nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:39">Trav 13:39</ref></char></note>yon nonm pa jistifye pa zèv Lalwa, men atravè lafwa an Kris Jésus a, nou menm kwè nan Kris Jésus a, pou nou kapab jistifye pa lafwa an Kris, e non pa zèv Lalwa, paske pa zèv Lalwa yo, okenn chè p ap jistifye. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Men si, pandan n ap chache jistifye nan Kris, nou menm osi jwenn nou kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:15">Gal 2:15</ref></char></note>pechè, èske konsa Kris se yon sèvitè a peche? Ke sa pa janm fèt! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Paske si mwen rebati sa ke, yon fwa, mwen te detwi a, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:5">Wo 3:5</ref></char></note>pwouve a tèt mwen ke mwen se yon transgresè. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Paske selon Lalwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>mwen te mouri a Lalwa a, pou mwen te kapab viv a Bondye. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Wo 6:6</ref></char></note>krisifye avèk Kris, epi se pa plis Mwen ki viv, men Kris viv nan mwen. Konsa, lavi ke m viv koulye a nan lachè, mwen viv pa lafwa nan Fis a Lòm nan, ki te renmen mwen e ki te bay tèt li pou mwen. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mwen pa anile lagras Bondye, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:21">Gal 3:21</ref></char></note>si ladwati vini selon Lalwa a, alò, Kris te mouri san rezon.”<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />O nou menm moun Galatie ensanse yo! Kilès ki gen tan mete wanga sou nou konsa, pou nou refize laverite a? Nou menm devan zye a kilès, Jésus Kri te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">I Kor 1:23</ref></char></note>piblikman prezante kòm krisifye a? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Sèl bagay ke m vle konnen de nou; Èske nou te resevwa Lespri a pa zèv Lalwa yo, oubyen pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:17">Wo 10:17</ref></char></note>tande avèk lafwa? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Èske nou si tèlman ensanse? Èske nou te kòmanse avèk Lespri a, epi koulye a nou ap vin pafè pa lachè? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Èske nou te soufri tout bagay sa yo anven—<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:2">I Kor 15:2</ref></char></note>si vrèman se te anven? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Alò, èske Sila ki founi nou avèk Lespri a e ki te fè zèv mirak pami nou yo, te fè li pa zèv Lalwa yo, oubyen pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:17">Wo 10:17</ref></char></note>tande ak lafwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Malgre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jen 15:6</ref></char></note>“Abraham te kwè Bondye, e sa te konte pou Li kòm ladwati.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Konsa, se pou nou asire ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Wo 4:16</ref></char></note>se sila ki nan lafwa yo ki se fis Abraham. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Lekriti sen an, ki te prevwa ke Bondye ta jistifye pèp etranje yo pa lafwa, te preche levanjil la davans a Abraham. Konsa, li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Jen 12:3</ref></char></note>“Tout nasyon yo va beni nan ou”. <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal 3:7</ref></char></note>sila ki nan lafwa yo, beni pa Abraham, kwayan an.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Paske tout sa ki nan zèv Lalwa yo anba yon madichon. Paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Det 27:26</ref></char></note>“Modi se tout moun ki pa respekte tout bagay ki ekri nan liv Lalwa a, pou fè yo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Alò, li klè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref></char></note>pèsòn pa jistifye pa Lalwa devan Bondye, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref></char></note>“Moun jis la va viv pa lafwa”. <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Sepandan, Lalwa a pa selon lafwa; okontrè: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>“Sila ki pratike yo a va viv pa yo menm.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kris te delivre nou de madichon Lalwa a, akoz Li te devni yon madichon pou nou—paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Det 21:23</ref></char></note>“Modi se tout moun ki pann sou yon bwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Pouke nan Kris Jésus, benediksyon Abraham yo ta kapab vini pou pèp etranje yo, pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:2">Gal 3:2</ref></char></note>ta kapab resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:33">Trav 2:33</ref></char></note>pwomès a Lespri Sen an pa lafwa.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:5">Wo 3:5</ref></char></note>mwen pale nan tèm relasyon moun ak moun; menm si se sèlman yon akò moun, depi li fin etabli, nanpwen moun k ap mete l sou kote oubyen ajoute kondisyon ladann. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Alò, pwomès yo te pale a Abraham ak posterite li. Li pa t di, “a posterite ou yo”, kòm referans a anpil moun, men de preferans a yon sèl moun: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Trav 3:25</ref></char></note>“E a posterite ou”, sa se Kris. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Sa ke m vle di a se sa: Lalwa, ki te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Jen 15:13</ref></char></note>kat-san-trant ane pita a, pa anile akò sa ki te deja etabli pa Bondye, kòmsi pou anile pwomès la. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Wo 4:14</ref></char></note>si eritaj la baze sou lalwa, li pa baze sou yon pwomès ankò; men Bondye te bay li a Abraham pa mwayen de yon pwomès.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 5:20">Wo 5:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, poukisa Lalwa a? Li te ajoute akoz de transgresyon yo, ki te òdone atravè zanj yo pa ajans a yon medyatè, jiskaske semans lan ta kapab rive a Sila pwomès la te fèt la. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:5">I Tim 2:5</ref></char></note>yon medyatè pa pou yon sèl pati, tandiske Bondye se yon sèl.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Konsa, èske Lalwa a vin kont pwomès a Bondye yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:16">Luc 20:16</ref></char></note>Ke sa pa ta janm fèt! Paske si te gen yon lwa ki ta kapab bay lavi, alò, ladwati ta vrèman baze sou Lalwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Men Lekriti sen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:32">Wo 11:32</ref></char></note>anchene tout bagay anba peche, pou pwomès la, pa lafwa nan Jésus Kri a, ta kapab bay a sila ki kwè yo.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Men avan lafwa te vini, nou te kenbe kòm yon depandan anba Lalwa, sans akse a lafwa ki t ap vin revele pita. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Konsa, Lalwa te devni pwofesè lekòl nou, pou mennen nou a Kris, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref></char></note>pou nou ta kapab jistifye pa lafwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Men koulye a, ke lafwa rive, nou pa anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:15">I Kor 4:15</ref></char></note>yon pwofesè lekòl ankò. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Paske nou tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:14">Wo 8:14</ref></char></note>fis a Bondye pa lafwa nan Kris Jésus. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Paske nou tout ki te batize nan Kris la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:14">Wo 13:14</ref></char></note>abiye tèt nou avèk Kris. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:22">Wo 3:22</ref></char></note>Pa gen ni Grèk, ni Jwif, ni esklav, ni lib, pa gen ni mal ni femèl; paske nou tout se youn nan Kris Jésus. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Epi si nou apatyen a Kris, nou se desandan a Abraham, eritye selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:8">Wo 9:8</ref></char></note>pwomès la.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Men mwen di nou, toutotan ke eritye a se yon timoun, li pa distenge ditou de yon esklav, malgre ke li se mèt a tout bagay, <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />men li anba gadyen ak sipèvizè yo jiska dat fikse pa papa a. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Menm jan an nou menm tou, lè nou te timoun, nou te kenbe an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:4">Gal 2:4</ref></char></note>esklavaj anba prensip <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:8">Kol 2:8</ref>,<ref loc="COL 2:20">20</ref></char></note>de baz a mond lan. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Men lè dat fikse a te rive, Bondye te voye Fis Li a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:25">Mat 1:25</ref></char></note>fèt de yon fanm, fèt anba Lalwa <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />pou Li ta kapab delivre sila ki te anba Lalwa yo, pou nou ta kapab resevwa adopsyon kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:14">Wo 8:14</ref></char></note>fis. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Akoz ke nou se fis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:7">Trav 16:7</ref></char></note>Bondye te voye Lespri a Fis Li a nan kè nou pandan L ap kriye: “Abba! Papa!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Konsa, nou pa yon esklav ankò, men yon fis; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:17">Wo 8:17</ref></char></note>si yon fis, alò, yon eritye atravè Bondye.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Sepandan, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:21">I Kor 1:21</ref></char></note>lè sa a, lè nou pa t konnen Bondye, nou te esklav a sila ki pa lanati pa t dye yo menm. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Men koulye a, akoz nou vin konnen Bondye, oubyen pito di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:3">I Kor 8:3</ref></char></note>vin konnen pa Li menm, kòman ke nou vire ankò a vye prensip de baz fèb yo, pou nou ta renmen vin esklav yo ankò? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:5">Wo 14:5</ref></char></note>obsève jou yo, mwa yo, sezon ak lane yo. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Mwen gen lakrent pou nou pou petèt mwen te travay ak nou anven.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mwen priye nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:18">Gal 6:18</ref></char></note>frè m yo, pou nou vin tankou mwen menm, paske mwen gen tan vin tankou nou. Nou pa t fè m okenn tò; <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />men nou konnen ke se te akoz yon maladi nan kò a ke m te preche levanjil la a nou menm nan premye fwa a. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Epi sa ki te yon traka pou nou nan kondisyon kò m nan, nou pa t ni meprize ni deteste nan mwen, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref></char></note>nou te resevwa mwen kòm yon zanj Bondye, kòm Kris Jésus Li menm.<verse eid="GAL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Alò, kote sans benediksyon sa a gen tan ale la a? Paske mwen pran nou kòm temwen ke si te posib, nou t ap rache pwòp zye nou pou nou te ban mwen. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Èske konsa mwen vin lènmi nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:10">Am 5:10</ref></char></note>akoz ke m di nou Verite a? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Yo chèche ou avèk zèl, pa pou bon rezon, men paske yo lanvi divize nou pou ou menm kapab al jwenn ak yo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Men se toujou bon si nou gen zèl pou sa ki bon, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:13">Gal 4:13</ref></char></note>pa sèlman lè m la avè nou.<verse eid="GAL 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Pitit mwen yo, ak nou m ap fè doulè akouchman nou ankò, jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:13">Ef 4:13</ref></char></note>Kris fòme nan nou— <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Men mwen ta swete prezan avèk nou koulye a pou chanje jan mwen refleshi sou nou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:8">II Kor 4:8</ref></char></note>mwen vin pa konprann nou.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Di mwen, nou menm ki vle anba Lalwa a, èske nou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:29">Luc 16:29</ref></char></note>tande Lalwa a? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Paske li ekri ke Abraham te gen de fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Jen 16:15</ref></char></note>youn pa fanm ki te esklav la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Jen 21:2</ref></char></note>youn pa fanm ki te lib la. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Wo 9:7</ref></char></note>fis pa fanm ki te esklav la te fèt selon lachè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:16">Jen 17:16</ref></char></note>fis a fanm ki te lib la te fèt selon pwomès la. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Sa se parabòl senbolik; de fanm sa yo se de akò. Youn te fèt nan Mòn Sinaï k ap pote pitit ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:3">Gal 4:3</ref></char></note>esklav yo; li menm se Agar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Alò, Agar sa a se Mòn Sinaï an Arabie. Li koresponn a Jérusalem ki la jis koulye a, paske li nan esklavaj avèk pitit li yo. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:22">Eb 12:22</ref></char></note>Jérusalem ki anwo a lib. Li se manman de nou tout. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Paske sa ekri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:1">És 54:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Rejwi, fanm esteril ki pa fè pitit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">eklate ak kri lajwa, ou menm ki pa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">nan doulè pou fè timoun nan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">paske pitit a sila ki aflije a plis an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">kantite pase sila ki gen mari a.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Epi nou menm, frè m yo, kòm Isaac, nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Wo 9:7</ref></char></note>pitit a pwomès la. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Men menm jan nan tan sa a, sila ki te fèt selon lachè a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Jen 21:9</ref></char></note>pèsekite sila ki te fèt selon Lespri a, se menm jan an koulye a. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Men kisa Lekriti Sen an di?: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Jen 21:12</ref></char></note>“Mete fanm esklav la deyò, avèk fis li a. Paske fis a fanm esklav la pa dwe yon eritye avèk fis a fanm lib la.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Alò konsa, frè m yo, nou pa pitit a yon fanm esklav, men a yon fanm lib.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 8:36">36</ref></char>
    </note>Se te pou libète ke Kris te fè nou lib. Konsa, kenbe fèm pou nou pa vin soumèt nou ankò a yon jouk esklavaj.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Gade, mwen menm, Paul, di nou ke si nou resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">Trav 15:1</ref></char></note>sikonsizyon, Kris p ap fè nou okenn benefis. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Epi mwen temwaye ankò a tout moun ki resevwa sikonsizyon, ke li anba obligasyon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:25">Wo 2:25</ref></char></note>kenbe tout Lalwa a. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Nou gen tan vin sevre de Kris, nou menm k ap chache vin jistifye pa Lalwa. Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Eb 12:15</ref></char></note>tonbe kite lagras. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Paske nou menm, atravè Lespri a, pa lafwa, n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:23">Wo 8:23</ref></char></note>tann esperans ladwati a. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Paske nan Kris Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:19">I Kor 7:19</ref></char></note>ni sikonsizyon, ni ensikonsizyon pa vle di anyen, men lafwa k ap aji atravè lanmou a.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Nou t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:2">Gal 2:2</ref></char></note>kouri byen! Kilès ki te vin jennen nou pou nou pa obeyi verite a? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Enfliyans sa a pa t sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>Sila ki te fè apèl de nou an. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">I Kor 5:6</ref></char></note>Yon ti kras ledven fè tout boul pen an vin leve. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mwen gen konfyans nan nou nan Senyè a, ke nou p ap adopte okenn lòt opinyon. Men sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:7">Gal 1:7</ref></char></note>twouble nou an va pote pwòp jijman pa li, nenpòt moun li ye a.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Men mwen, frè m yo, si mwen toujou preche sikonsizyon, poukisa mwen toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:12">Gal 6:12</ref></char></note>pèsekite? Alò, konsa blòk k ap fè moun bite a, ki se lakwa a, vin aboli. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Mwen swete ke sila k ap twouble nou yo ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:1">Det 23:1</ref></char></note>menm chatre pwòp kò yo.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Paske nou te rele pou libète, frè m yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:9">I Kor 8:9</ref></char></note>Sèlman pa fè libète nou an vin tounen yon opòtinite pou lachè, men selon lanmou, pou nou sèvi youn lòt. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Paske tout Lalwa a akonpli nan yon pawòl, nan fraz la; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note>“Ou va renmen pwochen ou tankou pwòp tèt ou.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Men si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:20">Gal 5:20</ref></char></note>mòde e devore youn lòt, fè atansyon pou nou pa fin manje youn lòt nèt.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Men mwen di nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:4">Wo 8:4</ref></char></note>mache pa Lespri a, e nou p ap akonpli dezi lachè yo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:5">Wo 8:5</ref></char></note>lachè mete dezi li yo kont Lespri a, e Lespri a kont lachè. Sila yo opoze a youn lòt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15">Wo 7:15</ref></char></note>pou nou pa ta fè tout sa ke nou pito. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Men si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:14">Wo 8:14</ref></char></note>mennen pa Lespri a, nou pa anba Lalwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Alò, zèv lachè yo klè: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 6:18">18</ref></char></note>Imoralite, salte, sansyalite <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />idolatri, fè maji, fè lènmi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:20">II Kor 12:20</ref></char></note>konfli, jalouzi, fè kòlè, dispite youn kont lòt, divizyon <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />lanvi, bwè tafya, banbochè, e tout bagay konsa yo, ke m avèti nou, menm jan ke m te avèti nou an, ke sila ki pratike bagay sa yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>eritye wayòm Syèl la.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:16">Mat 7:16</ref></char></note>fwi Lespri a se lanmou, lajwa, lapè, pasyans, ladousè, bonte, fidelite <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />jantiyès, tanperans; kont bagay sa yo, pa gen lwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Alò, sila ki pou Kris Jésus yo gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Wo 6:6</ref></char></note>krisifye lachè avèk tout pasyon ak dezi li yo.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Si nou viv pa Lespri a, annou osi mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16">Gal 5:16</ref></char></note>pa Lespri a. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Pa kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2:3</ref></char></note>vin gen ògèy, ni pwovoke youn lòt ni gen lanvi kont youn lòt.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Frè m yo, menm si yon moun vin kenbe nan nenpòt transgresyon, nou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:15">I Kor 2:15</ref></char></note>posede Lespri Bondye a, restore li avèk yon lespri dousè. Epi nou chak veye sou tèt nou pou nou pa osi vin tante. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:1">Wo 15:1</ref></char></note>Pote fado youn pou lòt, e konsa lalwa Kris la akonpli. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:36">Trav 5:36</ref></char></note>si yon moun panse ke li menm se yon bagay lè vrèman li pa anyen, li twonpe pwòp tèt li. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Men chak moun dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:28">I Kor 11:28</ref></char></note>egzamine pwòp zèv pa li, epi konsa li va gen rezon pou vante tèt li pou sa ke li menm fè, e pa pou sa yon lòt moun fè. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 9:12">Pwov 9:12</ref></char></note>chak moun va pote pwòp chaj pa l.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:11">I Kor 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 9:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Sila k ap aprann pawòl la dwe pataje tout bon bagay avèk sila ki enstwi l la.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Pa twonpe tèt nou; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:9">Job 13:9</ref></char></note>Bondye p ap moke; paske sa ke yon moun simen, se sa menm ke li va rekòlte. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Paske, sila ki simen pou pwòp chè li a, va, selon lachè, rekòlte koripsyon, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Wo 8:11</ref></char></note>sila ki simen pou Lespri a, va, selon Lespri a, rekòlte lavi etènèl. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Annou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:58">I Kor 15:58</ref></char></note>dekouraje nan fè byen, paske lè lè a rive, nou va rekòlte si nou pa fatige. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:27">Pwov 3:27</ref></char></note>pandan nou gen tan an, annou fè byen ak tout moun, e sitou a sila ki nan fanmi lafwa yo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Gade ak kalite gwo lèt m ap ekri nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">I Kor 16:21</ref></char></note>avèk pwòp men mwen. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Sila ki vle <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mat 23:27</ref></char></note>parèt bèl nan lachè yo eseye fòse nou sikonsi; senpleman pou yo menm pa ta pèsekite pou koz lakwa a Kris. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Paske sila ki sikonsi yo pa menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:25">Wo 2:25</ref></char></note>kenbe Lalwa pou tèt yo, men yo desire fè nou sikonsi pou yo kapab vante tèt yo nan lachè pa nou. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Men ke sa pa janm fèt pou m ta vante tèt mwen, eksepte nan lakwa a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kris. Atravè Li menm mond lan fin krisifye pou mwen, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 6:6">6</ref></char></note>mwen menm pou mond lan. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Paske nan Kris Jésus, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:26">Wo 2:26</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 2:28">28</ref></char></note>sikonsi pa anyen, ni pa sikonsi pa anyen, men nou devni yon kreyasyon tounèf. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Epi pou sila ki va mache pa prensip sila a, lapè ak gras sou yo, e sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:6">Wo 9:6</ref></char></note>Israël Bondye a.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Depi koulye a, pa kite pèsòn koze pwoblèm pou mwen, paske mwen pote sou kò m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:5">És 44:5</ref></char></note>mak a Jésus yo.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ke gras a Senyè nou an Jésus Kris kapab rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:22">II Tim 4:22</ref></char></note>avèk Lespri nou, frè m yo. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>